== Walkthrough ==

Upon creating a Barbarian Rogue, you will have a tattered note in your inventory. The note reads as follows:

: 'If you wish join our cause, give this note to [[Dun McDowell]]. He likes to hang out behind Cappi's, near the docks.'

Upon handing him the tattered note:

: [[Dun McDowell]] says, 'Ah.. ye wish to be a member o' the White Rose, then. eh? Well, let's train ye fer a bit. and see if ye've got what it takes.'

<div class='facblock'>
* Your faction standings with [[Rogues of the White Rose]] got better.
</div>

{{YouGainExperience}}

You also receive the [[Torn White Tunic*]]. Good luck, rogue!

